WEBVTT

00:02.981 --> 00:04.980
Priestesses of the Godless Month

00:02.981 --> 00:04.980
Kannazuki no Miko

00:13.510 --> 00:15.539
I will kill you.

00:15.540 --> 00:16.540
Chikane-chan.

00:17.580 --> 00:19.650
Chikane-chan will...

00:22.850 --> 00:24.319
Don't worry.

00:24.320 --> 00:26.670
I'll always protect you.

00:28.220 --> 00:30.790
Thank you, Oogami-kun.

00:35.500 --> 00:39.980
That day, exactly one month after
Chikane-chan's and my birthday...

00:41.000 --> 00:42.980
the sun is setting.

00:43.370 --> 00:47.010
The final sunset that symbolizes
the end of this world.

01:11.880 --> 01:15.945
Haruka ni sotto yurameku urei
kattou no kioku ni ugokasare

01:15.946 --> 01:20.009
Moving the slowly unfolding, distressing
troubles from afar that were in the past

01:20.010 --> 01:23.075
mabuta ni zutto haritsuku
shiroi zekkyou ni kogoeta

01:23.076 --> 01:26.139
Strongly closing the eyelids,
the white screams have frozen

01:26.140 --> 01:28.270
- shizumu tsuki no mayoi
- The confusion of the setting moon

01:28.900 --> 01:30.670
Sonzai wa tashikani Ima koko ni

01:30.671 --> 01:32.439
Surely my existence is here now

01:32.440 --> 01:34.150
- matte iru no wa
- Waiting for me

01:34.153 --> 01:35.485
Namida nado mou nagasanai

01:35.486 --> 01:36.819
There's no more tears to cry

01:36.820 --> 01:38.945
tada dakiaeru shunkan

01:38.946 --> 01:41.070
When the moment comes when
we embrace each other

01:41.530 --> 01:43.680
ienai kikenai mienai maboroshi dake

01:43.681 --> 01:45.830
Unspoken, unheard, unseen, just an illusion

01:46.040 --> 01:48.480
toki no mukou kawa e to nagasarete

01:48.481 --> 01:50.919
Flowing towards the other side of time,

01:50.920 --> 01:53.255
mayoigo ni naru yurusenu negai

01:53.256 --> 01:55.590
becoming like a lost
child, an unforgiven wish

01:55.880 --> 01:58.070
koe dake yubi dake chikazuku ondo dake

01:58.071 --> 02:00.259
Only voice, only fingers,
only the approaching warmth

02:00.260 --> 02:04.555
todokanu omoi ga chigirarete
yokaze o someru

02:04.556 --> 02:08.850
Unspoken thoughts get tainted
by the shredded night wind

02:27.540 --> 02:30.710
Let us begin now.

03:13.040 --> 03:15.545
Eleventh Episode

03:15.546 --> 03:18.050
Dance of Swords

03:21.360 --> 03:29.069
With the Mutsu Sword, I wish to begin
the ritual to cease the god to exist.

03:29.070 --> 03:32.690
Descend, god of swordsmen, Ame no Murakumo.

04:00.840 --> 04:03.840
This is Ame no Murakumo?

04:06.840 --> 04:08.179
Souma-kun!

04:08.180 --> 04:10.709
Focus. Orochi is coming.

04:10.710 --> 04:13.850
Long time no see, Ame no Murakumo.

04:26.780 --> 04:27.780
Miya-sama.

04:37.240 --> 04:39.670
I know that evil power.

04:40.610 --> 04:42.670
You're Orochi's true form?

04:42.980 --> 04:45.680
Chikane-chan, I didn't come to fight!

04:46.150 --> 04:48.519
I want to talk to you!

04:48.520 --> 04:51.680
I said tonight's party was just for us.

04:52.190 --> 04:55.310
Yet you brought that annoying friend.

04:56.340 --> 05:00.259
If you really want to talk,
then come to me alone.

05:00.260 --> 05:01.920
Wait, Chikane-chan!

05:02.330 --> 05:04.200
I'll be waiting, Himeko.

05:16.210 --> 05:17.979
Chikane-chan, why?

05:17.980 --> 05:22.249
Stop, Himeko. It's pointless
to talk to Himemiya now.

05:22.250 --> 05:22.710
But...

05:23.180 --> 05:25.130
Defeat Orochi itself first.

05:25.490 --> 05:27.220
Everything else comes after that!

06:02.790 --> 06:07.029
What power... It's almost
ruining my consciousness.

06:07.030 --> 06:11.300
The curse that consumes you
will further accelerate.

06:11.930 --> 06:13.969
The pain and torment will be...

06:13.970 --> 06:16.430
unlike your time on Take no Yamikazuchi.

06:17.340 --> 06:20.310
I don't know how much you can bear.

06:21.110 --> 06:24.320
You mean it's all up to me, Niisan.

06:25.210 --> 06:26.609
What's wrong, Souma-kun?

06:26.610 --> 06:28.950
Focus. They're still...

06:37.930 --> 06:42.420
You think you can beat the god
of swords without Tsubasa?

06:58.710 --> 07:01.270
Take no Yamikazuchi.

07:05.250 --> 07:07.919
Damn, I still have to endure.

07:07.920 --> 07:10.780
If I'm beaten, who'll protect Himeko?

07:11.780 --> 07:13.889
One more attack. Let's do it!

07:13.890 --> 07:15.290
Right, Souma-kun!

07:34.980 --> 07:37.970
Now it is my turn.

07:54.900 --> 07:55.990
What?

08:24.400 --> 08:25.860
They fused!

08:32.740 --> 08:34.870
Servant, come forth.

08:50.560 --> 08:51.560
Too sluggish.

08:53.800 --> 08:55.060
Take that!

09:09.110 --> 09:10.340
Souma.

09:20.120 --> 09:21.520
Himeko.

09:21.990 --> 09:23.220
Himeko.

09:26.030 --> 09:27.679
You okay, Himeko?

09:27.680 --> 09:29.340
Yes, how about you?

09:29.760 --> 09:32.420
Don't worry. I'll be fine.

09:32.900 --> 09:34.369
I'm sorry.

09:34.370 --> 09:38.569
Since I'm powerless... Since I
don't have the courage to...

09:38.570 --> 09:39.570
Himeko!

09:39.840 --> 09:41.039
What now?

09:41.040 --> 09:43.109
Souma-kun, what now?

09:43.110 --> 09:45.579
I won't see Chikane-chan at this pace.

09:45.580 --> 09:47.350
I'll let you see her.

09:48.680 --> 09:50.810
I can't stop Orochi.

09:51.250 --> 09:54.220
But you can stop Himemiya.

09:56.890 --> 09:59.490
I'll clear the path to Himemiya.

09:59.990 --> 10:02.160
But then you'll be...

10:02.460 --> 10:03.629
I...

10:03.630 --> 10:05.850
We came for that purpose.

10:06.170 --> 10:09.639
Until I fulfill that promise, I won't lose.

10:09.640 --> 10:12.169
I'll keep getting up to protect you.

10:12.170 --> 10:13.339
Souma-kun...

10:13.340 --> 10:15.980
That's what I've always said, right?

10:24.550 --> 10:27.620
You can still fight? You're so dumb.

10:32.390 --> 10:36.220
As an act of mercy, I shall fight with you.

10:36.730 --> 10:39.200
Try to amuse me at least.

10:39.670 --> 10:42.100
Chikane-chan, wait for me.

10:46.440 --> 10:48.439
Kill! Kill!

10:48.440 --> 10:50.210
Kill the priestess!

10:51.080 --> 10:53.709
Niisan, lend me strength.

10:53.710 --> 10:55.210
Strength to protect Himeko.

11:06.820 --> 11:07.850
I found it!

11:09.430 --> 11:10.460
Chikane-chan!

11:21.110 --> 11:23.370
Die, Ame no Murakumo!

11:41.630 --> 11:44.600
Kill the priestess.

11:45.920 --> 11:47.899
Go, Himeko!

11:47.900 --> 11:49.400
Don't look back.

11:50.040 --> 11:51.170
Go!

11:57.440 --> 11:59.439
Wait for me, Souma-kun.

11:59.440 --> 12:00.690
I'll come back.

12:01.280 --> 12:03.200
I'll definitely come back!

12:15.630 --> 12:17.030
Himeko.

12:40.720 --> 12:42.989
Come, Himeko.

12:42.990 --> 12:44.789
I'll kill you.

12:44.790 --> 12:45.790
Why?

12:46.570 --> 12:48.760
Don't get in my way!

12:56.240 --> 12:57.560
Chikane-chan...

13:07.050 --> 13:09.860
Where am I?

13:11.750 --> 13:12.779
Chikane-chan.

13:12.780 --> 13:15.770
Welcome to our party.

13:21.360 --> 13:23.659
Chikane-chan, where are we?

13:23.660 --> 13:27.029
The Lunar Shrine. Our previous lives.

13:27.030 --> 13:29.520
Or shall I call it the home of souls?

13:29.870 --> 13:32.370
The home of souls?

13:32.870 --> 13:35.370
You don't remember? Not even a bit?

13:37.240 --> 13:39.420
I don't really understand.

13:39.730 --> 13:40.749
I see.

13:40.750 --> 13:44.320
Well, it's better that you do not know.

13:45.690 --> 13:47.519
Where doesn't matter.

13:47.520 --> 13:49.930
Since it's an image created
by Orochi's power.

13:52.230 --> 13:54.999
You must be tired from running.

13:55.000 --> 13:57.029
Shall we have some tea?

13:57.030 --> 13:58.150
Or...

13:59.630 --> 14:01.150
Is this better?

14:02.370 --> 14:03.799
Which is best?

14:03.800 --> 14:06.309
The music room? Oogami Shrine?

14:06.310 --> 14:08.139
How about that beach?

14:08.140 --> 14:09.160
Stop it already!

14:10.310 --> 14:12.309
I'm not here to play.

14:12.310 --> 14:15.749
I'm here to confirm your truth.

14:15.750 --> 14:17.160
My truth?

14:17.920 --> 14:19.670
The Chikane-chan I know...

14:20.490 --> 14:22.889
is strong, kind, wonderful...

14:22.890 --> 14:24.259
She's...

14:24.260 --> 14:26.660
She's not someone who could do
something terrible like this.

14:28.730 --> 14:31.769
Do you hate me that much?

14:31.770 --> 14:34.299
Or did Orochi do something?

14:34.300 --> 14:36.160
Tell me, Chikane-chan!

14:36.570 --> 14:38.970
All right, I'll tell you.

14:40.570 --> 14:42.360
I'll tell your body.

14:51.490 --> 14:52.490
Chikane-chan!

15:00.030 --> 15:01.800
Chikane-chan, stop!

15:03.300 --> 15:04.610
Chikane-chan!

15:06.300 --> 15:07.840
I love you.

15:08.800 --> 15:10.260
I love your eyes.

15:10.870 --> 15:13.609
Shining eyes like the universe in spring.

15:13.610 --> 15:17.270
I love your kind gaze that's
like the spring sunlight.

15:22.170 --> 15:23.840
I love your hair.

15:24.210 --> 15:27.860
I love your smooth, silken
hair that waves in the wind.

15:30.060 --> 15:32.329
I love your lips.

15:32.330 --> 15:38.390
I love your lips that give honey kisses
and let me hear lonely sighs.

15:39.930 --> 15:41.720
I love your voice.

15:41.900 --> 15:46.040
I love your high, sweet, pure
voice that echoes in my heart.

15:56.280 --> 15:57.890
I love your body.

16:01.390 --> 16:05.129
Your slender waist, which
might break if I embrace it.

16:05.130 --> 16:08.159
I love the warmth that I feel...

16:08.160 --> 16:11.920
when I touch those small
but nicely shaped breasts.

16:13.170 --> 16:14.170
But...

16:14.470 --> 16:17.910
what I love the most is your heart.

16:18.370 --> 16:23.179
Fragile and easily broken, but
endlessly pure and beautiful.

16:23.180 --> 16:25.449
Your soul, filled with kindness...

16:25.450 --> 16:28.710
which never blames
others and forgives all.

16:36.720 --> 16:39.429
I love you. I really love you.

16:39.430 --> 16:43.260
I can't help loving
everything about you, Himeko.

16:49.540 --> 16:52.610
I don't need anything other than you.

16:53.040 --> 16:55.279
All I want is you.

16:55.280 --> 16:58.940
An everlasting night only for you and me.

16:59.350 --> 17:01.450
Yet the world is full of nuisances.

17:02.280 --> 17:06.960
Full of annoyances that interfere with us.

17:10.590 --> 17:12.970
So I'll destroy it all.

17:14.590 --> 17:17.029
We are sword priestesses.

17:17.030 --> 17:19.460
The more we seek each other...

17:20.200 --> 17:22.810
The more we touch, the more it hurts.

17:23.470 --> 17:24.809
To slash.

17:24.810 --> 17:26.609
To be slashed.

17:26.610 --> 17:29.360
That is how we swords love.

17:29.640 --> 17:31.320
Understand, Himeko?

17:34.980 --> 17:37.520
Now, let's continue.

17:38.020 --> 17:40.789
I'll engrave more of my truth on you.

17:40.790 --> 17:43.280
So engrave me as well, Himeko.

17:43.620 --> 17:45.529
Engrave me with you.

17:45.530 --> 17:47.250
Please, Himeko.

17:48.330 --> 17:50.259
Let's dance, Himeko.

17:50.260 --> 17:53.570
Until our lives end, let's
dance the waltz of swords.

17:54.430 --> 17:55.430
Chikane-chan...

17:57.270 --> 17:58.630
Chikane-chan...

18:00.270 --> 18:03.039
Great... This is great.

18:03.040 --> 18:07.449
The hateful priestesses who
sealed me in my previous life...

18:07.450 --> 18:09.319
are fighting each other.

18:09.320 --> 18:11.769
What could be more amusing?

18:11.770 --> 18:13.280
Chikane-chan!

18:18.860 --> 18:22.559
After all, love is a different
form of selfish desire.

18:22.560 --> 18:26.160
Just a decoratively worded
desire for exclusive possession.

18:33.710 --> 18:36.239
I win this time.

18:36.240 --> 18:39.430
My world, the world of Orochi, begins.

18:40.210 --> 18:42.319
Sing! Celebrate!

18:42.320 --> 18:46.079
The start of a dark world
stained with hate and nihilism.

18:46.080 --> 18:48.890
My world! The world of Orochi!

18:49.220 --> 18:53.900
Tear the human world apart.
Humans shall go extinct!

18:58.600 --> 19:00.170
Why, Himeko?

19:01.440 --> 19:04.239
I'm just dancing alone this way.

19:04.240 --> 19:06.670
You're ruining the party.

19:08.070 --> 19:11.290
Himeko, is it boring
with me as your partner?

19:11.680 --> 19:14.340
What will make you dance with me?

19:14.880 --> 19:16.110
Why?

19:17.550 --> 19:19.760
Why do you lie like that?

19:22.860 --> 19:25.989
You don't seem to be enjoying this at all.

19:25.990 --> 19:28.810
Even though you're smiling,
you don't look happy.

19:29.500 --> 19:32.620
Chikane-chan, you told me before.

19:33.360 --> 19:36.480
That you'd never stop me
from doing what I want.

19:37.380 --> 19:38.900
I feel the same way.

19:39.310 --> 19:42.570
If you want to do it, I want to support it.

19:42.890 --> 19:46.849
But looking at you now makes my heart ache.

19:46.850 --> 19:48.879
It's really painful.

19:48.880 --> 19:51.350
Why do I feel like this?

19:54.050 --> 19:56.130
It's because you're lying.

19:56.390 --> 19:59.259
Because this you isn't the truth.

19:59.260 --> 20:04.660
You wouldn't ever hurt those
dear to you, those who love you.

20:05.230 --> 20:07.760
You can't be okay with that.

20:08.270 --> 20:11.520
If you can't forgive me, that's fine, too.

20:11.840 --> 20:13.809
Do what you like.

20:13.810 --> 20:15.509
I'm sure...

20:15.510 --> 20:17.910
I'm sure it's my fault...

20:18.810 --> 20:22.250
But I'd hate to die while you're lying.

20:23.420 --> 20:27.990
I'd hate it more to die while
you're suffering from dishonesty.

20:28.590 --> 20:30.289
So tell me.

20:30.290 --> 20:34.000
Chikane-chan, tell me the truth.

20:35.530 --> 20:36.700
Himeko...

20:42.370 --> 20:44.890
You got it, Himeko.

20:47.010 --> 20:48.010
Chikane-chan.

20:52.680 --> 20:54.210
Chikane-chan...

21:05.160 --> 21:06.280
Chikane-chan!

21:22.480 --> 21:23.979
Satisfied?

21:23.980 --> 21:26.050
Now, let's continue...

21:26.980 --> 21:28.180
Himeko.

21:42.320 --> 21:44.070
Yes, that's it, Himeko.

22:10.140 --> 22:11.820
- Itsuka mita yume
- A dream that was once saw

22:11.823 --> 22:13.830
- Todokanai tsubuyaki dake
- Just a murmur that does not get through

22:13.833 --> 22:15.635
Yoru no hikari ni tsutsumarete samayoi yuku

22:15.636 --> 22:17.439
Wandering while wrapped up in night's light

22:17.440 --> 22:21.020
- Yagate mihiraku sono hitomi Unmei nara - If it
is fate, those eyes will be opened before long

22:21.023 --> 22:22.545
Semete Sou ima dake

22:22.546 --> 22:24.069
At least... yes, only now

22:24.070 --> 22:26.430
- Kanawanai to utsumuku - Looking
downward as the wish does not come true

22:26.433 --> 22:28.430
- Yokaze ni tada unadare
- Merely hanging my head in the night wind

22:28.433 --> 22:32.120
- Namida Tsukikage Te no hira ni afurete yuku - Tears
and moonlight continue to overflow from my palm

22:32.123 --> 22:33.690
- Nani ga hoshii no
- What do you want?

22:33.693 --> 22:35.910
Kuchibiru wa yami ni furuete ita

22:35.911 --> 22:38.129
My lips shivered in the darkness

22:38.130 --> 22:40.470
Deatta ano toki ni mune tsuita egao

22:40.471 --> 22:42.809
The smiling face that pierced
my chest when we came across

22:42.810 --> 22:45.750
Mamoritakute Zutto kuzuresou na yakusoku o

22:45.751 --> 22:48.689
I want to protect it, the promise
that always looks about to collapse

22:48.690 --> 22:50.725
Itami tsubusu hodo ni dakishimeteta

22:50.726 --> 22:52.760
I embraced it while crushing the pain

22:53.600 --> 22:55.015
Soba ni ireru dake de

22:55.016 --> 22:56.429
Just by being by my side

22:56.430 --> 22:58.240
Onaji jikan ni irareru dake de

22:58.241 --> 23:00.049
Just by remaining in the same time as me

23:00.050 --> 23:03.520
Tooi kioku Yomigaeru kanashimi
mo atatamete yukeru no ni

23:03.521 --> 23:06.989
The distant memory and
revived sadness can warmed

23:06.990 --> 23:08.970
Mawaritsuzukete iru omoi ni

23:08.971 --> 23:10.949
In the feelings that continue to circulate

23:10.950 --> 23:12.765
Yasuragi michita owari wa kuru no

23:12.766 --> 23:14.579
Will a peaceful ending come?

23:14.580 --> 23:16.400
Kurikaeshita toikake wa ten ni mai

23:16.401 --> 23:18.219
The repeated question dance in heavens

23:18.220 --> 23:23.745
Ake no sora no Hikari ni kawaru

23:23.746 --> 23:29.270
And turns into the light of the morning sky

23:40.060 --> 23:42.060
Next Time

23:42.720 --> 23:45.889
I was given a truth stained with blood.

23:45.890 --> 23:49.070
The sad and cruel tale of
the cycle of reincarnation.

23:49.960 --> 23:52.360
That's what I desired.

23:52.730 --> 23:59.039
My only answer, more precious than
any peace, happiness, or life.

23:59.040 --> 24:01.499
Priestesses of the Godless Month

24:01.500 --> 24:04.999
The final episode, Priestesses
of the Godless Month.

24:05.000 --> 24:08.560
Chikane-chan, please accept my truth.
